{"id":"4843","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4843_main_cirrus-fibratus-increasing_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>在一个阳光和温暖的下午之后，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的毛卷云在一个锢囚锋之前从西面迅速穿过天空。在中心可以看到一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乱云</span>云类致密的细丝，并且在图像的左下方可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">飞机凝结尾迹</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国伯克郡靠近雷丁的Stratfield Mortimer","latitude":"纬度: 51° 22' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 2' 24'' W","date":"24 July 2013 1755 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 4","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.0"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4843_syn_cirrus-fibratus-increasing_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在一个晴朗的夏日之后，一个锢囚锋从西部接近</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/4843_upper_cirrus-fibratus-increasing_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这是英国英格兰坎伯恩（03808）1200 UTC时（几乎8小时前）的上升流，位于西南325公里，靠近锋区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4843_sat_cirrus-fibratus-increasing_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这张仅仅一个多小时后的红外图像显示了在锢囚锋之前推进的大范围的高云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© NEODAAS/邓迪大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5175_main_cirrus-fibratus-intortus-cirrus-spissatus-and-altocumulus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图中主要为毛卷云极不规则弯曲的白色丝条。这些丝条极不规则地弯曲缠绕，表明为轻微的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乱</span>云类。毛卷云似乎是从絮状卷云发展而来，其中的一些云素<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">低垂在地平线</span>。还有一小排<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状卷云</span>、薄片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>，以及在地平线右侧的两个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">凝迹</span>。由于不列颠群岛西南方向的低气压以及延伸越过英国英格兰上空的低压槽，因此，当天在英格兰西南部出现阵雨，并出现了晨雷暴和大范围的对流云。极沿海地区当天下午基本是晴天。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stephen Burt","location":"英国，赫尔斯顿，利泽德半岛","latitude":"纬度: 49° 57' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 12' 14'' W","date":"10 August 2004 1640 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.8"}]}]}